            "zh": "导电布头 Ø7 mm"
          },
          "qty": "1"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "tall-left",
    "page": "tapz_11",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "TOUCH END",
        "zh": "触控机构"
      },
      "small": "tapz_11"
    },
    "variant": "hero",
    "figures": [
      {
        "src": "tapz_11_solenoid_attach_exploded_cam1_cjmx.svg"
      },
      {
        "src": "tapz_11_solenoid_attach_assembled_cam0.svg"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Ten hole pairs for height adjustment",
          "zh": "十对高度调节孔"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The mount has 10 pairs of holes, 1 mm apart. Pick one pair now. Later you can raise or lower the stylus in 1 mm steps.",
          "zh": "支架上有 10 对孔，间距 1 mm。先选一对安装。以后可按 1 mm 步进调整触控笔高度。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:50mm; top:20mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Route the power leads",
          "zh": "引线走线"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Feed the +/− leads of the solenoid into the rectangular hole in the side of the mount, as shown. 2. Run the leads up and out through the rectangular hole at the top.",
          "zh": "1. 按图把电磁铁的正负极引线从支架侧面的方孔穿入。2. 向上从顶部方孔引出。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:60mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Ground the solenoid",
          "zh": "电磁铁接地"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Clamp the bare copper of the ground wire between the solenoid housing and the mount. 2. Tighten one of the 2 mount screws to clamp it. 3. Run the ground wire out through the other rectangular hole below to join the power leads.",
          "zh": "1. 把接地线剥出的铜线夹在电磁铁外壳和支架之间。2. 拧紧其中一颗支架螺栓压住铜线。3. 把接地线从下方另一个方孔穿出，与正负极引线汇合。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:110mm; width:60mm;"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
