          "en": "Install the solenoid assembly on the belt clamp with 6 screws. To change the stylus height later, move the assembly to a different hole pair.",
          "zh": "用 6 颗螺栓把电磁铁组件固定在同步带夹具上。以后调整触控笔高度时，把组件移到另一对孔上。"
